    "abstract": "Illustrated parts figure for the fin box root rib, the shear ties and the lateral load introduction hardware, including the bolted strap fitted to high-cycle aircraft.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the fin box root rib items, the shear ties at the three lower stations, the splice plates and the anchor hardware for the lateral load introduction into the rear fuselage.",
      "figure_note": "The figure is drawn looking forward with the rudder removed and the fin leading edge open. The bolted lateral load strap at item 20 is fitted only to aircraft that have had the reinforcement embodied, and its anchor nuts are installed in the rib flange at embodiment, so the strap cannot be removed and refitted without a repair scheme."
    },
